...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
assessment_agent: Assessment 에이전트 { class: ours }
update_assessment_overview: update_assessment_overview { class: ours }
action_agent: Action 에이전트 { class: ours }
update_action_overview: update_action_overview { class: ours }
followup_agent: Follow-up 에이전트 { class: ours }
update_followup_overview: update_followup_overview { class: ours }

assessment_agent -> update_assessment_overview: 호출(1차 턴)
update_assessment_overview -> ui: 사이드바
action_agent -> update_action_overview: 호출(1차 턴)
update_action_overview -> ui: 사이드바
followup_agent -> update_followup_overview: 호출(1차 턴)
update_followup_overview -> ui: 사이드바
